.pages-inner
  Loader(v-show='loading')
  .content_part(v-if='props && !loading')
    Header()
    .innerpage-top(v-bind:style="{ backgroundImage: 'url('+ propspageheader.acf.innerpage_top_bg +')'}")
    .innerpage_content_wrap.content_full
      .container_manual.clearfix
        #content_left
          h1 Cookie Policy
          .content_all.policy-page
            p.policy-updated Last updated: October 22, 2026
            p This Cookie Policy explains how Goldberg Orthodontics uses cookies and similar technologies on www.goldbergortho.com. It should be read together with our #[router-link(to='/privacy-policy') Privacy Policy].

            h2 What cookies are
            p Cookies are small files that a website stores in your browser. Similar technologies, such as pixels, tags and local storage, work in a similar way. Some are needed for the website to work; others help us understand how the site is used or measure our advertising.

            h2 Your choices
            p We only use cookies that are strictly necessary unless you agree to more. When you first visit, you can accept all, reject all or choose by category, and you can change your mind at any time. Rejecting cookies does not affect your ability to use the website or request an appointment.
            button.cookie-prefs-btn(type='button' @click='openCookiePreferences') Change cookie preferences
            p If your browser sends a #[a(href='https://globalprivacycontrol.org/' target='_blank' rel='noopener') Global Privacy Control] (GPC) signal, marketing cookies are turned off and cannot be enabled. You can also block or delete cookies in your browser settings, though some parts of the website may then not work as expected.

            h2 Cookies we use
            h3 Strictly necessary (always on)
            p Needed for the website to work, keep it secure and remember your cookie choices.
            .policy-table-wrap
              table
                thead
                  tr
                    th Cookie / storage
                    th Provider
                    th Purpose
                    th Duration
                tbody
                  tr
                    td cc_cookie
                    td Goldberg Orthodontics
                    td Remembers your cookie choices
                    td 6 months
                  tr
                    td browserupdateorg
                    td Goldberg Orthodontics (browser-update.org)
                    td Remembers that you closed the outdated-browser notice
                    td Up to 1 week
                  tr
                    td uw-* (local storage)
                    td UserWay
                    td Remembers your accessibility settings
                    td Until cleared
                  tr
                    td __cf_bm, cf_clearance
                    td Vimeo (Cloudflare)
                    td Security checks for embedded videos
                    td Up to 1 year

            h3 Analytics (off unless you allow them)
            p Help us understand how visitors use the website so we can improve it.
            .policy-table-wrap
              table
                thead
                  tr
                    th Cookie
                    th Provider
                    th Purpose
                    th Duration
                tbody
                  tr
                    td _ga, _ga_*
                    td Google Analytics
                    td Distinguishes visitors and sessions
                    td Up to 13 months

            h3 Marketing (off unless you allow them)
            p Measure and improve our advertising and help us follow up on enquiries. These providers may combine this data with other information they hold about you.
            .policy-table-wrap
              table
                thead
                  tr
                    th Cookie
                    th Provider
                    th Purpose
                    th Duration
                tbody
                  tr
                    td _gcl_au, _gcl_*
                    td Google Ads
                    td Measures ad clicks and conversions
                    td 90 days
                  tr
                    td _fbp, _fbc
                    td Meta (Facebook / Instagram)
                    td Measures ad performance and form submissions
                    td 90 days
                  tr
                    td prism_*
                    td ActiveCampaign
                    td Records website visits for email follow-up
                    td 30 days

            p Some of these providers also set cookies on their own websites (for example facebook.com or doubleclick.net). If you withdraw consent we stop loading their tools on this website, but we cannot delete cookies stored on their domains; you can remove those in your browser settings or on the provider's website.

            h2 Changes to this policy
            p We will update this policy when the cookies we use change. The "Last updated" date at the top shows when it last changed.

            h2 Contact us
            p Questions about cookies or privacy? Call us at #[a(href='tel:+15164841123') (516) 484-1123] or email #[a(href='mailto:drgoldberg@goldbergortho.com') drgoldberg@goldbergortho.com].

    Footer()
